flowchart LR
    View["Activity / View"]
    VM["TaskViewModel with TaskUiState StateFlow"]
    Repo["TaskRepository"]
    API["REST API"]
    DAO["TaskDao"]
    Room[("Room Database: TaskEntity")]

    View -->|User actions| VM
    VM -->|Refresh create or toggle| Repo
    Repo -->|GET refresh| API
    API -->|Successful task response| Repo
    Repo -->|Persist successful remote read| DAO
    Repo -->|Create or PATCH completion first| API
    API -->|Mutation success only| Repo
    Repo -->|Write after mutation success| DAO
    DAO -->|Observe and query| Room
    Room -->|Room-backed query results| DAO
    DAO -->|Flow of mapped Tasks| Repo
    Repo -->|Tasks and operation outcomes| VM
    VM -->|StateFlow| View

    API -.->|Read failure retains cache or reports Error| Repo
    API -.->|Mutation failure means no Room write| Repo
    VM -.->|"Offline create and toggle rejected with user feedback; no queue or retry"| View
